{"3201800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Infinite Nowhere", "steam_appid": 3201800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Celes</strong>, a lone android aboard the derelict research vessel <strong>Helios-R1</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ship is failing. The crew is breaking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cosmic anomaly known as the <strong>Helix</strong> is unraveling space and twisting the laws of everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reach what lies beyond comprehension and find your place in the infinite unknown?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Poetic Sci-Fi Story Across The Universe</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a deeply emotional journey as Celes, forming fragile bonds with the crew through intimate, tension-filled conversations. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover what happened aboard Helios-R1 through personal  logs, artifacts, and environmental clues that reveal the crew’s collapse and humanity’s fragile place in the universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/797757275954df974b170fb137621611.poster.avif?t=1784145094\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/797757275954df974b170fb137621611.webm?t=1784145094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/797757275954df974b170fb137621611.mp4?t=1784145094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reach, Decode And Survive The Infinite</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the Helios-R1 alive and hold reality together as 